# Project Requirements

## Project Name
Financial and Inventory Management System

## Main Objective
To develop a system for managing and analysing financial and inventory-related data of an organization.

## Main Requirements
- Sales management
- Purchase management
- Expense management
- Inventory management
- Customer and supplier management
- Accounts receivable and payable
- Cash transaction management
- Financial calculations and reports
- SQL database for data storage
- Python for system implementation
- Power BI dashboards for financial and inventory analysis

